# Production Environment Variables
# DO NOT commit this file with real values!
# Set these in your hosting provider (Vercel dashboard)

NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_NAME=Laundry App
NEXT_PUBLIC_CURRENCY=₦

# Notes:
# - NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL should be your deployed PHP backend URL (HTTPS, no trailing slash)
# - Update backend FRONTEND_URL to match your frontend domain for CORS
# - After first deploy, update backend .env with your actual frontend URL